kev / NeoHorse-derived research implementations

This repository includes research implementations derived from the NeoHorse
kev training package, originally distributed under Apache License 2.0.
The retained original license text is in this directory's LICENSE file.

The JEV study modifies training recipes, classification heads, adapter scopes,
initialization/reference handling, export/runtime interfaces and evaluation
controls. The repository's source map identifies the selected study variants.
These modifications are project code; the original attribution and applicable
upstream license continue to apply to the derived implementations.

NeoHorse model weights and tokenizer payloads are separate external assets.
Upstream model reference: https://huggingface.co/TokenRhythm/NeoHorse-1-4B
